"%(path)s"

msgid ""
"The button in the bottom bar opens the selection for the section you have "
"open. From there the ticked entries can be printed, exported or moved to the "
"wastebasket."
msgstr ""
"Knappen i den nederste bjælke åbner markeringen for den sektion, du har "
"åben. Derfra kan de markerede poster udskrives, eksporteres eller flyttes "
"til papirkurven."

msgid "The calendar backend could not verify a missing appointment."
msgstr "Kalenderens backend kunne ikke bekræfte en manglende aftale."

msgid "The calendar backend reported an incomplete result."
msgstr "Kalenderens backend rapporterede et ufuldstændigt resultat."

